<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27353" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διπλᾰσι-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>double,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				920a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				20p.465M.
			</span></i>, etc.: —
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Prodic.
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.534
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. λέγεται διχῶς: ἢ γὰρ τόπον . .
					μένοντος τοῦ πλήθους τῶν ἀνδρῶν, ἢ τὸν ἀριθμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ascl.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					10.17
				</span></i>
			; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὸ βάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.24.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>reduplicate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				62.23
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				237.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>double</i> a consonant, Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.932
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>repeat</i> a metrical phrase, in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				1.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>to be twice the size of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					4.84
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be doubled in value,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				32.25
			</span></i>.</div>
